  "description": "If anyone asked me to name the worst day of my life, I wouldn't hesitate for a single second. The nightmare of that day—when both of us thought we were tops—came back to haunt me in a dream about Yoo Seung-hoon, the guy responsible for that total disaster. And not just any dream, but a shameless one where he's begging me to take him. Was that dream some kind of omen?\n\nTwo years later, we cross paths again in what should be the most wholesome place on earth. Only this time, Seung-hoon has a kid in tow: A little boy who looks like an exact carbon copy of him.\n\n*“Wait... did I just have a wet dream about a single dad?!”*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000081370)",
